      The <a href="/riemann-splice-questions/#t-rh-xi-ledger-stationarity">completed-ledger stationarity
      attempt</a> then proves that even weak quadratic stationarity is RH-equivalent, while every off-line
      quartet has strict negative residue variation. The <a href="/riemann-splice-questions/#t-rh-principal-prime-anchor">principal-prime
      follow-up</a> reduces the missing law to conservation of one absolutely convergent Euler anchor at
